{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the <strong>DECRYPTO project!</strong> I am <strong>Inky</strong>, the official <strong>INKorp</strong>\u00a0virtual assistant. Your job is to train an advanced AI model so that it becomes familiar with various text encryption systems and better understands human language. During the next week, you will be subject to the following responsibilities:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Analyze</strong> encoded texts to reverse the encryption and determine the key by using specialized software apps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep alert for <strong>special tasks</strong> where you\u2019ll need to deduce the encryption system yourself. Send us the encryption parameters quickly\u2014don\u2019t waste time reading the content!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earn INKredits</strong> by completing your daily tasks. Use them to unlock new applications, customize your InkOS system, or access paid news articles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under any circumstance, <strong>do not perform</strong> any of the following activities: deliberately failing tasks, engaging with individuals of malicious intent, or exploiting potential flaws of the InkOS system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perform your duties diligently for a week and you will discover why the <strong>DECRYPTO project</strong> is necessary to save humanity! </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Game Over","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3565680/56fb4c03cc541e8ebd856ea9be20bb9c0153f81a.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565680?t=1763559851","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565680/6465aa6d5d5f0dcf562ece177d171e931f8cb7cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763559851","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste